From: Gerwout van der Veen <gerwoutvdveen@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DSi: SoftResetCount, the soft resets counted for the frontend

SoftReset() runs inside RunFrame(); the counter lets the frontend detect it after the frame.
---
--- a/src/DSi.cpp
+++ b/src/DSi.cpp
@@ -765,6 +765,7 @@

 void DSi::SoftReset()
 {
+    SoftResetCount++;
     // TODO: check exactly what is reset
     // presumably, main RAM isn't reset, since the DSi can be told
     // to boot a specific title this way
--- a/src/DSi.h
+++ b/src/DSi.h
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@
     u16 SCFG_BIOS;
     u16 SCFG_Clock9;
     u32 SCFG_EXT[2];
+    u32 SoftResetCount = 0;  // incremented by SoftReset()

     std::array<u8, DSiBIOSSize> ARM9iBIOS;
     std::array<u8, DSiBIOSSize> ARM7iBIOS;
